[{"id":180124748,"discussion_id":"8041709adf8f38f941119a5fb2ca5782816f9051","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 topkv2 算子在 NonTranspose 模板下的精度问题。问题源于 `ComputeTopkNonLastLayout` 函数中，当启用归并排序（merge sort）时，value 输出行的 UB 对齐计算未考虑 `SORT_STRUCT_BYTES` 所需的空间，导致对齐不足进而引发精度偏差。修复方式与同函数内已有的 `valueAxisRawBytes` 处理逻辑保持一致，引入 `valueOutputRawBytes` 变量并在 merge sort 场景下取 `sortDtypeSize` 与 `SORT_STRUCT_BYTES` 对应字节数的较大值参与对齐计算。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `valueOutputRawBytes` 变量**：在 `top_k_v2_tiling_arch35.cpp` 的 `ComputeTopkNonLastLayout` 函数中，用局部变量 `valueOutputRawBytes` 替代原来直接内联的 `static_cast<uint64_t>(outputCount) * sortDtypeSize` 表达式，使 value 输出行字节数的计算逻辑更清晰且可调节。\n- **Merge sort 场景下调整 value 输出行字节数**：当 `useMergeSort` 为 `true` 时，`valueOutputRawBytes` 会取 `outputCount * sortDtypeSize` 与 `outputCount * SORT_STRUCT_BYTES` 中的较大值，确保归并排序所需的额外结构体空间被纳入 UB 对齐计算。\n- **对齐计算改用 `valueOutputRawBytes`**：将 `CeilAlignUint32` 调用中 value 行的字节数参数由原始表达式替换为 `valueOutputRawBytes`，使对齐计算与实际需要的空间一致，避免因低估空间导致的精度问题。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:03:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:05:01+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180124750,"discussion_id":"32f0638d3d95e5e2f1b6f8febd6c7a843810e01d","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-15T14:03:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:19:03+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":180124759,"discussion_id":"0b413e7a37bf6bff5da91b91f485dc9a32840be5","body":"## CL